WEBVTT

00:00:00.020 --> 00:00:03.030
Let's make our dream come true!

00:00:03.620 --> 00:00:06.020
Today's another day of idol activities!

00:00:06.020 --> 00:00:08.260
Aikatsu! is about to start.

00:01:47.770 --> 00:01:49.870
<i>I'm Kiriya Aoi. {not sure whether to italicize all of these, or just starting in the next cut. the next one is necessary to differentiate, but these are all narration}</i>

00:01:49.870 --> 00:01:51.500
<i>And I'm Shibuki Ran.</i>

00:01:51.820 --> 00:01:58.030
<i>We attend an idol school called Starlight Academy, where all the students are active idols.</i>

00:02:01.240 --> 00:02:04.630
<i>Today's another day of idol activities, or Aikatsu for short.</i>

00:02:04.630 --> 00:02:06.440
<i>As always, I'm going full-out!</i>

00:02:10.840 --> 00:02:14.860
Here's the lead actress of <i>Naughty Police Chief: The Movie</i>, Kiriya Aoi-chan!

00:02:14.860 --> 00:02:19.170
<i>My main focus is on my work as an actress.</i>

00:02:19.170 --> 00:02:22.580
Even police chiefs pack a punch! {...}

00:02:23.200 --> 00:02:26.070
<i>And my focus is on my modeling work.</i>

00:02:26.980 --> 00:02:31.930
<i>Right now, I'm doing shoots as the representative model for my favorite brand, Spicy Ageha.</i>

00:02:32.840 --> 00:02:34.240
Aoi-chan!

00:02:34.240 --> 00:02:34.840
She's so cute!

00:02:34.840 --> 00:02:36.090
Go for it! {???}{chatter, whatever}

00:02:38.880 --> 00:02:40.110
<i>Ichigo?</i>

00:02:41.770 --> 00:02:44.390
<i>Yeah, of course it's not Ichigo.</i>

00:02:48.790 --> 00:02:52.480
<i>This is my best friend and favorite idol, {more goddamn narration. }</i>

00:02:52.480 --> 00:02:53.730
<i>Hoshimiya Ichigo.</i>

00:02:54.570 --> 00:02:58.780
<i>It's been one year since Ichigo left Starlight Academy.</i>

00:02:59.460 --> 00:03:01.150
<i>So it's already been a year...</i>

00:03:01.150 --> 00:03:04.650
<i>I wonder what Ichigo's up to in America.</i>

00:03:05.550 --> 00:03:08.200
<i>At first, we texted each other as much as we could,</i>

00:03:08.200 --> 00:03:10.290
<i>but now it's only once in a while.</i>

00:03:10.740 --> 00:03:15.550
<i>I'm sure she's relentlessly pursuing her Aikatsu somewhere in America right now.</i>

00:03:15.930 --> 00:03:17.180
<i>Like...</i>

00:03:17.180 --> 00:03:19.240
<i>...maybe at the Statue of Liberty?</i>

00:03:19.240 --> 00:03:22.800
Aikatsu! Aikatsu! Aikatsu!

00:03:24.050 --> 00:03:26.060
<i>That might be a </i>bit <i>too crazy.</i>

00:03:28.560 --> 00:03:30.130
Are they not coming?

00:03:30.130 --> 00:03:32.060
I heard they'd be here soon, though.

00:03:43.500 --> 00:03:44.320
Good work today.

00:03:44.320 --> 00:03:46.380
Ran, you too.

00:03:47.050 --> 00:03:49.120
Are you done for the day after this recording?

00:03:49.120 --> 00:03:49.970
Yeah.

00:03:49.970 --> 00:03:52.000
We have some time, so why don't we have some tea inside?

00:03:52.000 --> 00:03:54.920
Sure, we can get ready for the recording there too.

00:03:57.020 --> 00:04:00.570
<i>Right. In the year that's passed since Ichigo left,</i>

00:04:00.570 --> 00:04:03.620
<i>there's been a major development in the world of idols.</i>

00:04:04.410 --> 00:04:09.690
<i>A new idol school called Dream Academy has made its appearance.</i>

00:04:10.770 --> 00:04:15.860
<i>The idols at Dream Academy, or DreAca for short, are really popular right now! {Doriaka?}</i>

00:04:16.860 --> 00:04:20.230
Those Dream Academy girls sure are popular.

00:04:20.230 --> 00:04:21.110
Yeah!

00:04:21.110 --> 00:04:23.360
That's Sora-chan and Maria-chan.

00:04:23.360 --> 00:04:26.160
Those two are really something special!

00:04:26.160 --> 00:04:30.370
Everyone's been talking about nothing but DreAca recently.

00:04:30.600 --> 00:04:34.120
Yeah, and they've been doing really well in the idol rankings.

00:04:34.120 --> 00:04:38.680
And to think that just one year ago, all the idols in those rankings were from Starlight Academy.

00:04:38.680 --> 00:04:42.510
Right, but this is something that happens a lot in the world of idols.

00:04:43.220 --> 00:04:49.000
You'll often see new and passionate new idols breathing down the backs of the established ones.

00:04:50.170 --> 00:04:53.160
We're witnessing history unfold!

00:04:53.160 --> 00:04:54.390
Really, what we're seeing...

00:04:54.390 --> 00:04:56.020
...is really something special.

00:04:56.020 --> 00:04:57.030
That!

00:04:58.730 --> 00:04:59.880
Seriously.

00:04:59.880 --> 00:05:04.030
You really get carried away when you talk about idols.

00:05:04.030 --> 00:05:07.910
DreAca is our rival. <i>We're</i> the ones whose backs they're breathing down. {trying to be sparing}

00:05:07.910 --> 00:05:11.570
But still, as an idol professor, this really gets my blood tingling!

00:05:11.570 --> 00:05:14.930
Say that again and I'll have to suck that blood of yours.

00:05:14.930 --> 00:05:16.150
Yurika-sama!

00:05:17.170 --> 00:05:19.290
Kaede-chan, good work today.

00:05:19.290 --> 00:05:20.270
Good work.

00:05:20.270 --> 00:05:21.260
Same to you.

00:05:21.260 --> 00:05:23.210
I ran into Yurika there.

00:05:23.210 --> 00:05:27.460
Seriously. This is no time to be fangirling over DreAca.

00:05:28.070 --> 00:05:31.680
Starlight Academy's just been so somber lately.

00:05:32.110 --> 00:05:35.940
Everyone's like a vampire on the beach in summer.

00:05:36.310 --> 00:05:37.280
Really?

00:05:37.280 --> 00:05:39.160
I wouldn't go that far.

00:05:39.160 --> 00:05:40.270
Ran's right!

00:05:40.270 --> 00:05:41.820
Cheer up!

00:05:41.820 --> 00:05:44.320
Powa Powa Puririn! {...}

00:05:44.320 --> 00:05:46.820
Powa-ring up! {......}{yes}

00:05:47.130 --> 00:05:48.740
Good to see you all. {I don't even know}

00:05:48.740 --> 00:05:50.120
You too!

00:05:50.120 --> 00:05:52.870
Of course <i>you</i> three are in high spirits.

00:05:52.870 --> 00:05:57.580
Powa Powa Puririn's the one group at Starlight Academy that's still going strong.

00:05:57.580 --> 00:05:59.830
You even have a show named after you.

00:06:00.580 --> 00:06:05.220
We've received praises saying that we were not of this world,

00:06:05.220 --> 00:06:10.140
but rather in a world of our own!

00:06:10.140 --> 00:06:15.480
PowaPuri does a lot of stuff like attending candy festivals and going bird watching.

00:06:15.480 --> 00:06:17.140
People love how freely you go about things.

00:06:17.140 --> 00:06:21.610
We just focus on having fun.

00:06:21.610 --> 00:06:23.890
We have so much fun that it worries me.

00:06:23.890 --> 00:06:25.500
And on top of that,

00:06:26.070 --> 00:06:31.110
our leader, Otome-sama, is the reigning Starlight...

00:06:31.110 --> 00:06:33.910
...Queen!

00:06:33.910 --> 00:06:34.810
Remember? {eriogfnhjdrkogtnoenfowerjgiodtrjgh}

00:06:34.810 --> 00:06:36.220
She's really great.

00:06:36.220 --> 00:06:39.190
I got to follow in Mizuki-san's footsteps!

00:06:39.190 --> 00:06:40.670
It was thanks to all of you!

00:06:40.670 --> 00:06:41.990
Don't say that.

00:06:41.990 --> 00:06:43.920
You're selling yourself short.

00:06:44.900 --> 00:06:47.060
You're embarrassing me...

00:06:47.060 --> 00:06:49.330
The recording's going to begin soon.

00:06:49.330 --> 00:06:50.070
Yeah.

00:06:50.070 --> 00:06:51.930
Later then.

00:06:51.930 --> 00:06:53.830
See you later!

00:06:53.830 --> 00:06:56.000
Things sure have gotten crazy.

00:06:56.000 --> 00:06:56.810
That's right.

00:06:57.300 --> 00:06:59.190
If we let our guards down at all,

00:06:59.190 --> 00:07:03.160
those idols from Dream Academy will steal all our jobs.

00:07:06.280 --> 00:07:08.320
I knew it. Idols are great.

00:07:08.830 --> 00:07:12.440
When I saw you girls, I started to hear it.

00:07:12.440 --> 00:07:13.950
My rock music, that is.

00:07:13.950 --> 00:07:15.350
Rock?

00:07:16.720 --> 00:07:19.110
If you're <i>do</i>, then I'm <i>re</i>.

00:07:19.110 --> 00:07:21.460
If you're <i>re</i>, then I'm <i>mi</i>.

00:07:22.310 --> 00:07:23.560
I won't lose to you!

00:07:26.800 --> 00:07:28.010
Cool.

00:07:28.010 --> 00:07:29.560
Yeah, she really was.

00:07:29.560 --> 00:07:31.110
Just who was she?

00:07:31.110 --> 00:07:33.300
She's really got some personality.

00:07:33.690 --> 00:07:34.940
Is she an idol?

00:07:35.460 --> 00:07:36.510
Who could she be?

00:07:40.060 --> 00:07:43.610
I looked on the internet for information on that girl,

00:07:43.610 --> 00:07:44.810
but nothing's coming up.

00:07:45.160 --> 00:07:48.020
If even <i>you</i> can't find any information on her, {emphasis}

00:07:48.020 --> 00:07:49.820
maybe she's not an idol.

00:07:49.820 --> 00:07:50.920
Yeah.

00:07:50.920 --> 00:07:53.050
That's what it seems like,

00:07:53.050 --> 00:07:55.950
but she really reminds me of Ichigo from a year or so back.

00:07:57.430 --> 00:07:59.410
She had the scent of an idol!

00:07:59.410 --> 00:08:01.330
I could really smell it.

00:08:05.330 --> 00:08:07.840
Good morning, everyone.

00:08:08.310 --> 00:08:12.340
Sorry for the short notice, but I have two 
important announcements for you today.

00:08:12.340 --> 00:08:14.090
What could it be?

00:08:14.570 --> 00:08:17.970
The first concerns the clothes that you will wear on stage.

00:08:17.970 --> 00:08:23.230
Aikatsu cards have undergone a historic advancement.

00:08:24.150 --> 00:08:25.230
Advancement?

00:08:25.720 --> 00:08:28.180
The brands that produce Aikatsu cards

00:08:28.180 --> 00:08:32.050
have all combined to create outfits with a single theme.

00:08:32.050 --> 00:08:34.860
This year's theme will be "constellations".

00:08:36.330 --> 00:08:41.120
As of this moment, each of the top brands have released their Constellation Dresses.

00:08:41.120 --> 00:08:42.600
Constellation Dresses!

00:08:42.600 --> 00:08:43.870
I can't wait!

00:08:44.240 --> 00:08:46.940
I'm expecting these dresses to open up

00:08:46.940 --> 00:08:50.380
exciting new possibilities in the world of Aikatsu.

00:08:50.380 --> 00:08:54.630
Let's all Aikatsu hard and wear these dresses to their fullest potential!

00:08:54.630 --> 00:08:56.060
Yes, yes!

00:08:56.060 --> 00:08:58.390
I approve!

00:08:59.390 --> 00:09:01.430
Aikatsu will get even more passionate!

00:09:01.430 --> 00:09:02.890
I so approve!

00:09:02.890 --> 00:09:04.250
This is wonderful!

00:09:04.250 --> 00:09:05.640
Miss Tiara!

00:09:06.020 --> 00:09:07.860
You weren't supposed to go on stage yet.

00:09:07.860 --> 00:09:09.770
I just couldn't wait!

00:09:09.770 --> 00:09:12.150
You don't mind, do you, Headmistress Orihime?

00:09:14.910 --> 00:09:18.910
I'm sure most of you already know her, but allow me to introduce her once again.

00:09:19.390 --> 00:09:26.060
This is Yumesaki Tiara, the headmistress of our rival idol school, Dream Academy.

00:09:26.770 --> 00:09:29.650
Greetings! I'm Yumesaki Tiara.

00:09:29.650 --> 00:09:31.970
Aikatsu! Aikatsu!

00:09:33.050 --> 00:09:38.440
Headmistress Tiara is here to join in the 
unveiling of our second announcement.

00:09:39.730 --> 00:09:45.060
Dream Academy and Starlight Academy will be holding a face-off concert.

00:09:45.060 --> 00:09:46.200
Us and DreAca?

00:09:46.200 --> 00:09:47.560
A face-off concert?

00:09:49.890 --> 00:09:52.890
In the year since Dream Academy was founded,

00:09:52.890 --> 00:09:58.230
idols from DreAca and Starlight have not once stepped on stage together. {I get the feeling they're going to keep using these abbrevs}

00:09:58.780 --> 00:09:59.750
But then,

00:09:59.750 --> 00:10:03.900
I asked if we could hold a concert together!

00:10:04.480 --> 00:10:07.830
I'm so happy I get to learn from the respected Headmistress Orihime!

00:10:07.830 --> 00:10:12.910
We hope that this face-off concert will liven up everyone's Aikatsu.

00:10:14.150 --> 00:10:14.710
Alright!

00:10:14.710 --> 00:10:18.430
Let's get right to announcing the idols who will be participating.

00:10:18.430 --> 00:10:20.130
My school's representative

00:10:20.130 --> 00:10:23.740
will be a massively new idol who will be sure to carry us on her shoulders for years to come.

00:10:23.740 --> 00:10:25.980
You'll have to wait until the concert to see who she is.

00:10:25.980 --> 00:10:27.530
A massively new idol?

00:10:27.530 --> 00:10:28.730
As in she's tall?

00:10:28.730 --> 00:10:35.610
And the idol I've chosen to represent our school at this historic concert is

00:10:35.610 --> 00:10:39.290
the popular singer and movie star,

00:10:39.290 --> 00:10:40.760
Kiriya Aoi!

00:10:41.510 --> 00:10:42.490
Me?! {interroBANG}

00:10:42.880 --> 00:10:46.210
I'm looking forward to sharing the stage with DreAca.

00:10:46.210 --> 00:10:48.620
Let's all enjoy ourselves!

00:10:49.030 --> 00:10:51.180
Great for you, Aoi.

00:10:52.380 --> 00:10:59.120
Starlight Academy and Dream Academy have just announced a face-off concert.

00:10:59.120 --> 00:11:03.140
There's no doubt that this will be a concert that will change the face of idol history.

00:11:03.140 --> 00:11:05.820
Things sure escalated quickly. {sorry, but I couldn't think of anything better}

00:11:06.870 --> 00:11:08.790
Headmistress Orihime!

00:11:08.790 --> 00:11:09.730
What?!

00:11:09.730 --> 00:11:11.650
What are you saying?

00:11:11.650 --> 00:11:15.150
If Kiriya loses, you're going to resign as headmistress?

00:11:15.150 --> 00:11:20.860
If she loses, Dream Academy will become the dominant force in the idol world,

00:11:20.860 --> 00:11:23.530
and Starlight Academy will have less and less room to shine.

00:11:24.140 --> 00:11:25.400
If that were to happen,

00:11:25.400 --> 00:11:29.330
as the person who accepted the challenge, I must take responsibility.

00:11:30.980 --> 00:11:32.780
<i>If I lose...</i>

00:11:32.780 --> 00:11:35.100
<i>...Headmistress Orihime will resign?</i>

00:11:46.620 --> 00:11:48.390
It's almost time for your idol debut.

00:11:48.890 --> 00:11:51.230
I know you'll be able to open new doors. {asdbheri}{ugh}

00:11:51.590 --> 00:11:54.060
That's why I became an idol.

00:11:54.060 --> 00:11:57.730
I wanted to open new doors so the sound of my music could carry further.

00:11:58.140 --> 00:12:01.030
And remember, the doors you open aren't just for yourself.

00:12:01.670 --> 00:12:03.740
You'll be opening doors for all Aikatsu.

00:12:04.870 --> 00:12:07.080
Me? How?

00:12:08.290 --> 00:12:10.450
Don't worry about it.

00:12:10.450 --> 00:12:12.960
Aikatsu! Aikatsu!

00:12:12.960 --> 00:12:14.650
Are you going to keep running?

00:12:14.650 --> 00:12:15.530
Yeah.

00:12:15.530 --> 00:12:18.970
If I don't win, Headmistress Orihime is going to resign.

00:12:19.960 --> 00:12:24.090
And I'm sure that Dream Academy's "massively new idol" is going to be super strong.

00:12:24.090 --> 00:12:25.760
Why do you think that?

00:12:26.160 --> 00:12:29.770
They have more than just idols at DreAca.

00:12:29.770 --> 00:12:33.480
We have a producer course at DreAca.

00:12:33.480 --> 00:12:34.270
Okay.

00:12:34.270 --> 00:12:36.730
Put your faith in your producer.

00:12:37.100 --> 00:12:39.980
She'll be able to bring out your charms

00:12:39.980 --> 00:12:42.220
in a way that will be sure to open doors.

00:12:43.500 --> 00:12:45.450
The day is finally upon us.

00:12:45.450 --> 00:12:49.370
Dream Academy vs. Starlight Academy: Face-off Concert!

00:12:49.840 --> 00:12:52.790
DreAca's representative will be taking the stage on the first day.

00:12:54.260 --> 00:12:55.670
Thanks.

00:12:55.670 --> 00:12:57.380
Tomorrow's concert.

00:12:57.380 --> 00:13:00.380
Kiriya-honey, just do what you always do. {it's too good to pass up}

00:13:00.750 --> 00:13:02.010
Yes.

00:13:02.010 --> 00:13:04.370
What's important isn't whether we win or lose.

00:13:04.370 --> 00:13:06.200
But you know that already, right?

00:13:06.200 --> 00:13:07.180
Yeah?

00:13:07.180 --> 00:13:08.420
Yes.

00:13:08.420 --> 00:13:11.130
What's important isn't the result.

00:13:11.130 --> 00:13:12.390
Correct.

00:13:13.800 --> 00:13:16.310
The most important thing is that our fans have fun.

00:13:17.200 --> 00:13:18.810
You're the girl from earlier!

00:13:21.030 --> 00:13:23.320
My name is Otoshiro Seira. {Sera?}{no}

00:13:23.320 --> 00:13:26.160
Otoshira Seira-chan?

00:13:26.160 --> 00:13:27.320
Yeah.

00:13:27.320 --> 00:13:29.950
I want to introduce myself properly this time.

00:13:29.950 --> 00:13:33.410
This is my first concert as idol. I used to be a roc—

00:13:33.410 --> 00:13:35.510
No, no, no!

00:13:35.510 --> 00:13:36.920
What is it, Kii? {Key?}

00:13:36.920 --> 00:13:39.100
Pro-pro-produce!

00:13:39.100 --> 00:13:40.920
As for who I am,

00:13:40.920 --> 00:13:42.950
I'm Saegusa Kii.

00:13:42.950 --> 00:13:46.700
A third-year in Dream Academy's producer course.

00:13:46.700 --> 00:13:47.840
Nice to meet you.

00:13:49.420 --> 00:13:52.800
Now, it's ok-ok-okay for me to introduce myself,

00:13:52.800 --> 00:13:55.020
but Seira, you're a massively new idol!

00:13:55.020 --> 00:13:58.440
It's way better to reveal information about yourself little by little.

00:13:58.440 --> 00:14:01.420
Like how you used to be in a rock band with your friends,

00:14:01.420 --> 00:14:03.570
or how you played classical music before that,

00:14:03.570 --> 00:14:05.830
or how you have absolute pitch.

00:14:05.830 --> 00:14:07.700
You're an idol with countless secrets!

00:14:08.060 --> 00:14:10.070
Like how your family runs a cafe,

00:14:10.070 --> 00:14:12.130
or how you have a little sister.

00:14:12.130 --> 00:14:13.980
We'll slowly reveal these to the public, and...

00:14:13.980 --> 00:14:15.110
Hey, Kii!

00:14:17.400 --> 00:14:20.710
You pretty much just said everything there is about me. {how sad}

00:14:20.710 --> 00:14:22.630
Suddenly she seems...

00:14:22.630 --> 00:14:23.880
...not so mysterious anymore.

00:14:25.290 --> 00:14:27.220
Now that you mention it, I did!

00:14:29.320 --> 00:14:31.100
But I get where you're coming from, Kii-chan!

00:14:32.490 --> 00:14:35.390
You love Seira-chan, don't you?

00:14:35.390 --> 00:14:38.010
That's why you want to tell everyone all about her!

00:14:38.820 --> 00:14:40.940
Bin-bin-bingo!

00:14:41.990 --> 00:14:44.300
Kii, we need to get ready.

00:14:44.300 --> 00:14:45.070
Okay.

00:14:47.140 --> 00:14:52.230
When I saw you girls, it reminded me of how amazing idols were.

00:14:52.230 --> 00:14:54.240
The sound of rock resonated in me.

00:14:55.490 --> 00:14:58.940
But if you're <i>do</i>, then I'm <i>re</i>.

00:14:58.940 --> 00:15:01.080
If you're <i>re</i>, then I'm <i>mi</i>.

00:15:01.730 --> 00:15:03.500
I'll always be a step ahead of you. {I like how the musical term "step" actually means the distance between two notes on the major scale}

00:15:08.760 --> 00:15:11.820
So <i>that's</i> what she meant by <i>do</i> and <i>re</i>.

00:15:11.820 --> 00:15:15.110
Her idol scent is really something special. {or "The scent of an idol is strong with this one."}

00:15:22.250 --> 00:15:25.020
Alright. Starting now, I'm an idol.

00:15:25.020 --> 00:15:26.460
That's right, Seira.

00:15:26.460 --> 00:15:27.610
Everything is...

00:15:27.610 --> 00:15:29.450
...ok-ok-okay!

00:15:30.610 --> 00:15:32.920
Hearing you say that is really reassuring.

00:15:32.920 --> 00:15:35.450
I'm still new to being an idol.

00:15:35.800 --> 00:15:37.410
That's part of what makes you great.

00:15:37.410 --> 00:15:38.160
Huh?

00:15:38.980 --> 00:15:44.920
You were raised by the sound of music, playing the piano, violin, and guitar... {need I convey that it is not limited to those three}

00:15:45.620 --> 00:15:47.800
You even delved into rock.

00:15:48.220 --> 00:15:52.740
With your background in music, you'll be sure to do great as an idol!

00:15:52.740 --> 00:15:57.990
Yeah! I became an idol because I wanted to stand on stage, unchained by any instrument.

00:15:57.990 --> 00:16:00.060
Right, and now's your time.

00:16:01.210 --> 00:16:02.690
I'll be counting on you, Kii.

00:16:02.690 --> 00:16:04.060
Produce me well.

00:16:04.060 --> 00:16:05.800
Leave it all to me.

00:16:05.800 --> 00:16:07.320
I can see it already.

00:16:09.680 --> 00:16:12.380
First we do this, and then...

00:16:11.080 --> 00:16:12.220
Wh-What?

00:16:13.780 --> 00:16:14.570
Done!

00:16:16.490 --> 00:16:17.560
Now you're an idol,

00:16:17.560 --> 00:16:18.870
Otoshiro Seira.

00:16:20.490 --> 00:16:21.600
I like it.

00:16:21.600 --> 00:16:22.830
Me, an idol!

00:16:22.830 --> 00:16:24.970
And also also also!

00:16:24.970 --> 00:16:27.840
What's really important here are the Aikatsu cards that you wear on stage.

00:16:27.840 --> 00:16:30.840
"To idols, cards are life itself," right?

00:16:30.840 --> 00:16:31.910
Right.

00:16:31.910 --> 00:16:34.340
And these are just the cards for your debut.

00:16:35.720 --> 00:16:38.200
Swing Rock's premium coord.

00:16:38.200 --> 00:16:41.890
I got the top designer to make these just for you.

00:16:41.890 --> 00:16:43.870
This dress looks great.

00:16:43.870 --> 00:16:45.190
I see it already!

00:16:45.190 --> 00:16:47.860
I see you, controlling the flow of sound,

00:16:47.860 --> 00:16:51.500
dancing in the music, bringing joy to everyone listening!

00:16:51.500 --> 00:16:53.060
Thanks, Kii.

00:16:53.060 --> 00:16:54.400
Don't thank me.

00:16:54.400 --> 00:16:55.190
Now...

00:16:56.690 --> 00:16:59.050
Put on that Special Coord in your heart.

00:16:59.050 --> 00:17:01.370
Now you're completely ok-ok-okay!

00:17:01.370 --> 00:17:03.350
Great, thank you.

00:17:06.090 --> 00:17:08.500
<i>I will become my ideal self.</i>

00:17:08.940 --> 00:17:11.530
<i>In the midst of the music, in complete control.</i>

00:17:11.530 --> 00:17:14.550
<i>That will be my idol activity.</i>

00:19:48.620 --> 00:19:50.340
What was that appeal?

00:19:50.340 --> 00:19:51.540
A constellation?

00:19:51.540 --> 00:19:52.600
Astounding!

00:19:52.600 --> 00:19:58.800
In her very first concert, the new idol, Otoshiro Seira, has performed an appeal we've never seen before!

00:19:58.800 --> 00:20:00.490
<i>What an appeal.</i>

00:20:00.490 --> 00:20:02.010
<i>What a brilliant performance!</i>

00:20:02.330 --> 00:20:04.390
According to the information we've just received,

00:20:04.390 --> 00:20:08.310
the appeal that was just performed is called a "Constellation Appeal". {should things be capitalized?}{to match Special Appeal}

00:20:08.990 --> 00:20:10.520
A Constellation Appeal.

00:20:10.520 --> 00:20:12.180
I can't do that...

00:20:12.180 --> 00:20:13.560
Aoi...

00:20:13.560 --> 00:20:16.570
Seira, Kii. Great concert!

00:20:16.570 --> 00:20:20.070
With that Constellation Appeal, victory is practically ours!

00:20:21.810 --> 00:20:23.990
Do you really think we've won?

00:20:26.400 --> 00:20:29.660
If Starlight Academy's former idol, Hoshimiya Ichigo, were the sun, {or take out both commas}

00:20:30.050 --> 00:20:32.230
you would be the star Antares.

00:20:32.230 --> 00:20:34.920
It shines ten thousand times more brightly than the sun. {wikipedia says 57500 times}

00:20:39.830 --> 00:20:41.420
Mark of the Scorpio.

00:20:41.820 --> 00:20:45.300
It's an honor conferred only to those idols who can perform the Constellation Appeal. {distinction, }

00:20:55.520 --> 00:21:01.010
Constellation Appeals are appeals that can only be performed when wearing the new constellation dresses.

00:21:01.010 --> 00:21:03.650
But not just anyone can perform them.

00:21:04.120 --> 00:21:09.070
You have to max out the audience's voltage meter before you can make the appeal.

00:21:10.170 --> 00:21:12.430
<i>It all comes down to my skills as an idol.</i>

00:21:13.450 --> 00:21:15.920
<i>What would Ichigo do?</i>

00:21:18.250 --> 00:21:19.920
<i>Well, for now...</i>

00:21:20.270 --> 00:21:21.740
<i>Why not have some seaweed? {I get the feeling she's talking to Aoi. Also, too bad she didn't become Yoda or something}</i>

00:21:30.790 --> 00:21:33.060
Do you think we're going to win?

00:21:33.530 --> 00:21:35.420
As long as she doesn't come back.

00:21:35.420 --> 00:21:37.440
The girl with piercing brilliance who never backs down,

00:21:38.330 --> 00:21:39.900
Hoshimiya Ichigo.

00:21:42.310 --> 00:21:44.680
It's time for the second day of the face-off concert.

00:21:44.680 --> 00:21:46.990
Today is Starlight Academy's turn.

00:21:46.990 --> 00:21:50.450
Starlight Academy's representative will be Kiriya Aoi-chan.

00:21:50.450 --> 00:21:53.860
It appears hopeless for them if she is unable to perform a Constellation Appeal.

00:21:54.580 --> 00:21:56.040
Just ignore them.

00:21:56.040 --> 00:21:59.330
But if I fail, Headmistress Orihime will...

00:22:00.730 --> 00:22:03.430
Big news! Big news! Big news! Big news!

00:22:03.430 --> 00:22:04.840
This is super big!

00:22:04.840 --> 00:22:06.180
What happened, Otome?

00:22:06.180 --> 00:22:07.960
I saw! I saw! {............}

00:22:07.960 --> 00:22:10.660
What? Did you see a Constellation Appeal?

00:22:10.660 --> 00:22:12.100
Nope.

00:22:12.100 --> 00:22:14.100
It's me!

00:22:18.590 --> 00:22:19.900
I'm home, girls!

00:22:19.900 --> 00:22:20.860
Did you miss me?

00:23:55.680 --> 00:23:57.740
This week's Aikatsu aphorism!

00:23:58.640 --> 00:23:59.830
Welcome home, Ichigo!

00:23:59.830 --> 00:24:02.730
It's been a week... no, a year since I last saw you!

00:24:02.730 --> 00:24:03.360
Yeah!

00:24:03.360 --> 00:24:06.000
Let's say this aphorism with our renewed feelings!

00:24:07.020 --> 00:24:09.880
To idols, cards are still life itself!

00:24:11.250 --> 00:24:12.760
Ichigo's back!

00:24:13.120 --> 00:24:14.180
It's great to be back!

00:24:14.180 --> 00:24:17.060
I want to try doing a Constellation Appeal too!

00:24:18.020 --> 00:24:19.560
Next time on Aikatsu!

00:24:19.560 --> 00:24:21.080
Welcome home, Strawberry.

00:24:21.080 --> 00:24:23.040
Always passionate, idol activities!
